  topic: "Translating Verbal Phrases into Algebraic Expressions"
  question: "Nine more than one-fourth of a number $k$."
  answer: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a5ff0e0f594f4f218b1f530c97f61284, type: 2}
  encourageDialogue:
  - "Well done! You got it right."
  tauntDialogue:
  - "Nope! Not even close."
  solutionDialogue:
  - "Turn each part of the phrase into math, then join the pieces."
  - "The expression is $\\frac{k}{4}+9$."
